menu "kqp"

    config KQP_AO_WATCH
        bool "Watch every Active Object for a stuck or starved step"
        default y
        help
            Panics with a core dump naming any Active Object that stays inside
            one event, or holds events and dispatches none, for 30 s. A step
            longer than KQP_AO_STEP_MAX_MS is logged as a warning. Initial
            transitions are not watched. Needs the task watchdog
            (CONFIG_ESP_TASK_WDT_EN).

            If unsure, say Y.

    config KQP_AO_STEP_MAX_MS
        int "Longest step an Active Object may take, in ms"
        depends on KQP_AO_WATCH
        range 100 10000
        default 5000
        help
            A step longer than this is logged as a warning, with its length. The
            time includes waiting for a core, so a low-priority Active Object
            can pass a second while others run.

endmenu
